sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client<br/>(CI / Dashboard / Script)
    participant WH as WheelHub API<br/>(:8080)
    participant Handler as Repos Handler
    participant Config as repos.yaml<br/>(Config Layer)

    Client->>WH: GET /api/repos
    WH->>Handler: route request
    Handler->>Config: read repo topology
    Config-->>Handler: repo list (name, strategy, branch, zones)
    Handler-->>WH: serialize to JSON
    WH-->>Client: 200 OK — JSON array of repos

    Client->>WH: GET /api/repos/pennyfarthing
    WH->>Handler: route request
    Handler->>Config: lookup by name
    Config-->>Handler: single repo record
    Handler-->>WH: serialize to JSON
    WH-->>Client: 200 OK — repo detail object

    note over Config: Single source of truth.<br/>No data duplicated.